To find {eq}\beta{/eq}, use Snell's Law:

{eq}\dfrac{n_2}{n_1}\sin\beta = \dfrac{n_3}{n_2}\sin\theta_1{/eq}

Given {eq}n_{air} = 1{/eq}, {eq}n_{water} = 4/3{/eq}, {eq}n_{air} = 1{/eq}, and {eq}\theta_1 = 47.78^\circ{/eq}:

